# The dirk-ui-studio package, symlinked to your working copy.
#
# web/ no longer depends on it. dirk_lib is public and released from a public
# build, and the only thing that imported it was the Design page's live
# thumbnails - a page nothing in game can reach until dirk_loading and
# dirk_multichar ship their design editors. Carrying it meant every build of the
# library needed credentials for a private repo to render one unreachable tile.
#
# The folder is still ignored because it is a working symlink for the resources
# that DO use the package. Putting the dependency back is one line in
# web/package.json and one import in LiveThumb.tsx, which says how.
.studio
